data: {"id": "1a99045ecd4c48e3-thinking-parallel_evidence-1091", "run_id": "1a99045ecd4c48e3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与因果\n\n| 维度 | 关键事实 |\n|------|----------|\n| Pod Status | `Running` (Phase) but `Ready=False`, `ContainersNotReady`, Reason=`CrashLoopBackOff`, Restart Count=6 |\n| Last State | Terminated, Exit Code=78, Reason=Error |\n| Previous Log | `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing` |\n| Container Env | `Environment: <none>` — 未定义 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` |\n| Command (YAML) | 容器命令直接读取 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 环境变量：不存在则打印错误并 `sys.exit(78)`，否则打印成功并 `sys.exit(0)` |\n| Events | 25 次 `BackOff` 事件，间隔", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789140433309, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

